{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "5\u756a\u7dda\u304a\u3058\u3055\u3093\u6551\u51fa\u7de8 Platform 5 Dungeons",
    "steam_appid": 3503680,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is NOT an \u201cExit 8-like\u201d!<br>A game where you must escape a station teeming with anomalies!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At long last, from the immensely popular Japanese anomaly-hunting series \u201c2\u756a\u7dda | Nibansen,\u201d \u201c3\u756a\u7dda | Sanbansen,\u201d \u201c4\u756a\u7dda | Platform 4\u201d\u2014collectively known as the \u201cBansen Series\u201d\u2014comes the very first story-driven horror game!<br>Even if you\u2019re new and start with this title, you can still fully enjoy the story and immerse yourself in this world!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The mystery behind the beloved character \u201cOjisan,\u201d the \u201cmysterious object,\u201d and the \u201canomalous phenomena\u201d is about to be revealed\u2026!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The setting is Chijuku Station\u2014a complex station so labyrinthine it\u2019s nicknamed the \u201cChijuku Dungeon.\u201d<br>When an \u201canomalous phenomenon\u201d occurs and an evacuation order is issued, the protagonist, a member of a rescue team, goes in to save Ojisan, who has been left behind all alone\u2026</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Please Note]</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We request your cooperation in picking up trash throughout the day at this station. If you see any trash, please pick it up right away and use it as a weapon. Thank you for your help.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter anything suspicious within the station, run away immediately.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please search for Ojisan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Ojisan\u2019s trust.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Estimated Playtime]<br>1\u20132 hours</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Video Posting Guidelines]<br>We wholeheartedly welcome any video uploads.<br>We\u2019re happy if more people learn about the game and have fun playing it.<br>Hence, you are free to livestream or do commentary on any MFC STUDIO game.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[A Word from the Creator]<br>This is my last project before graduating from university. I will be taking a temporary break from game development after I graduate, so I hope you enjoy this final work.</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is NOT an \u201cExit 8-like\u201d!<br>A game where you must escape a station teeming with anomalies!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At long last, from the immensely popular Japanese anomaly-hunting series \u201c2\u756a\u7dda | Nibansen,\u201d \u201c3\u756a\u7dda | Sanbansen,\u201d \u201c4\u756a\u7dda | Platform 4\u201d\u2014collectively known as the \u201cBansen Series\u201d\u2014comes the very first story-driven horror game!<br>Even if you\u2019re new and start with this title, you can still fully enjoy the story and immerse yourself in this world!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The mystery behind the beloved character \u201cOjisan,\u201d the \u201cmysterious object,\u201d and the \u201canomalous phenomena\u201d is about to be revealed\u2026!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The setting is Chijuku Station\u2014a complex station so labyrinthine it\u2019s nicknamed the \u201cChijuku Dungeon.\u201d<br>When an \u201canomalous phenomenon\u201d occurs and an evacuation order is issued, the protagonist, a member of a rescue team, goes in to save Ojisan, who has been left behind all alone\u2026</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Please Note]</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We request your cooperation in picking up trash throughout the day at this station. If you see any trash, please pick it up right away and use it as a weapon. Thank you for your help.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter anything suspicious within the station, run away immediately.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please search for Ojisan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Ojisan\u2019s trust.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Estimated Playtime]<br>1\u20132 hours</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Video Posting Guidelines]<br>We wholeheartedly welcome any video uploads.<br>We\u2019re happy if more people learn about the game and have fun playing it.<br>Hence, you are free to livestream or do commentary on any MFC STUDIO game.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[A Word from the Creator]<br>This is my last project before graduating from university. I will be taking a temporary break from game development after I graduate, so I hope you enjoy this final work.</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The long-awaited sequel to Japan\u2019s hit \u201cNibansen\u201d is here! This new rescue-horror in the \u201cBansen Series\u201d goes beyond anomaly hunting. Enter massive Senjuku Station (\u5343\u5bbf), full of oddities, and save the stranded old man. Now the truth of \u201cNibansen,\u201d \u201cSanbansen,\u201d and \u201cPlatform 4\u201d is revealed\u2026",
